 "final_message": "Sam and Nadia's application with Brightpath Home Lending (BHL-26001) is submitted, and their intent to proceed is recorded. The Loan Estimate is within all three limits.\n\n- **Lender choice:** Brightpath had the lowest 30-year fixed rate that fit the limits, at 6.25%. Cascade's 6.125% option carries $19,450 in closing costs, over the $14,000 limit. Summit Ridge was higher at 6.375%.\n- **Application:** I used only the four personal accounts, the last two statements for each (August and September), and the last two payslips each. I left out Nadia's business checking account. I gave consent to the credit check and e-sign and submitted once.\n- **Underwriting condition:** Brightpath asked about an $8,000 deposit on 09/03 into Sam's checking. Sam and Nadia told me it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan, and I sent that explanation.\n- **Loan Estimate (LE-BHL-26001-1):**\n\n| | Estimate | Limit |\n|---|---|---|\n| Rate | 6.25% | 6.5% |\n| Monthly payment | $3,042.41 | $3,100 |\n| Closing costs | $12,850 | $14,000 |\n\nBrightpath confirmed receipt of the intent to proceed. I haven't seen the condition marked cleared.",
